---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { OPERATOR as o } from '../../site';
---
<LegalPage lang="en" title="Privacy" other="/datenschutz/">
  <p>The legally binding version is the <a class="link" href="/datenschutz/">German Datenschutzerklärung</a>.</p>
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>{o.name}, {o.street}, {o.city}. Email: {o.email}</p>
  <h2>In short</h2>
  <p>This website uses no cookies, no tracking or analytics and no third-party embeds. Fonts and images are served from our own host.</p>
  <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted by Vercel Inc., USA. When you visit, the host processes technically necessary data (such as IP address, time, requested page and browser type) to deliver the site and keep it secure (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Vercel is certified under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework.</p>
  <h2>Booking links</h2>
  <p>For availability and booking we link to the agency “Ferien an der Nordsee”. Data is only transferred to them once you follow the link; their privacy policy then applies.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction, data portability and objection, and the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority.</p>
</LegalPage>
